After you have unlocked [[Paragon|Paragon level 9]] ''(1e80 [[Mysteries]])''; you will unlock the ability to collect [[Resources]] (also known as [[Crafting Dust]]) from the colored Resource Jars, which are located in the background along with the Void Traps. Click on the jars in order to collect their resources. These resources are used to craft and upgrade [[Items]].

This page will explain the mechanics of dusts, items, and crafting. For an article on the general strategy of crafting and upgrading items, see the [[Item Guide]].

==Item Quality==
All items fall into various qualities:
* '''<span style="color:#9D9D9D;">Common</span>'''
* '''<span style="color:#1EFF00;">Uncommon</span>'''
* '''<span style="color:#0070FF;">Rare</span>'''
* '''<span style="color:#A335EE;">Epic</span>'''
* '''<span style="color:#FF8000;">Legendary</span>'''
* '''<span style="color:#00CCFF;">Unique</span>'''
Most items have a starting quality from '''<span style="color:#9D9D9D;">Common</span>''' to '''<span style="color:#0070FF;">Rare</span>'''. Each upgrade increases its quality to the next tier, up to '''<span style="color:#FF8000;">Legendary</span>''', and further increases the bonuses it grants.

'''<span style="color:#00CCFF;">Unique</span>''' items start out at maximum quality.

When you equip an item, if you do not have the required [[Attributes]] to use the item, it will be red and its effects will not work.

==Gathering==
[[File:Skill jar.png|left]]
Increases resource jars accumulation and Enchanting Dust passive speed collection by 3% per level.

Gathering starts at level 0 and requires 1000 experience to level up, increasing by 20% per level. Each resource collected grants 0.05 gathering experience points.
{{Clear}}
Each of the 4 Resource Jar makes its own color of Resources:
* [[File:Resource Red.png|x32px]] Red
* [[File:Resource Green.png|x32px]] Green
* [[File:Resource Blue.png|x32px]] Blue
* [[File:Resource Gold.png|x32px]] Yellow

The base '''average''' earn rate '''for each jar''' is:
<br><math>0.022\times 0.6369\times 2.352\approx 0.033</math>
<br>per second (<math>118.64</math> per hour, <math>2847.38</math> per day)

All but Legacy and Trial Milestones modifiers are multiplicative. The actual accumulation uses a sine function that will average out to all jars gathering at the same rate, but at any give time it will appear that some jars are gathering faster than others. The initial maximum for each jar is 2000 (increased by up to 10000 through [[Trials|Trial perks]] and [[Paragon#Legacy|Legacy perks]], also increased by 2000 from {{ItemTooltip|item_name =Beholding Eye}}, and multiplied by 3 if you wear {{ItemTooltip|item_name =Light Of Eighth Star}}. Online, jars will earn variable amounts based on total time played; Offline they will be uniform.

Resources may be traded at a 3:1 rate, by clicking on the scale icon. Use the up/down arrows to select which colors & how much to exchange. Ctrl-click:10, Shift-click:100, Alt-click 1000, and Ctrl+Shift click is all. (Thank you, darkhemming!)

