==Crafting==
[[File:Skill crafting.png|left]]
Increases progress earned when crafting or upgrading an item, and increases Enchanting Dust earned from Experiments. The bonus is 5% per level.

Crafting starts at level 0, and requires 1000 experience to level up, increasing by 20% per level. Increasing your Crafting level increases the progress gained from each action by 5% per level (additively).
{{Clear}}
Items are crafted and upgraded incrementally by spending various amounts of the four crafting dusts. Each crafting or upgrade operation adds a predetermined amount of progress towards the next item or upgrade level. When crafting new items, progress beyond 100% will overflow into the next item. When upgrading items, if the progress of the next upgrade would reach 98% you get the rest for free and will fully upgrade the item.

Additional crafting progress per action can be given by the following items: {{ItemTooltip|item_name=The Artificer's Crown}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Artificer's Shoulderpads}} and {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Scales of Appraisal}}.

The following table displays the rates at which crafting XP is gained, and the amounts of resources consumed by different actions. Note that the crafting bonus in the table is the effect from crafting levels multiplied by the crafting efficiency from items.

