====Optimizing edust experiment====
You should aim to max out the Timeless Fame and Phantom Reputation [[Realm Upgrades]] and do at least 1 [[Trials|Trial]] for the 160 milestone, ideally wait for 250 or 330 (can do multiple edust phases, a smaller at the start of the realm).

Restored Rituals + Timeless Frame + Phantom Reputation + Forgotten Might + Foreseeable Results + Fundamental Distortions + Overblown Aspirations if you have edust trial perks higher than 400. Forbidden Might lvl 1 if getting 1e10+ edust.

Equip {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Enchanting Membrane}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Artificer's Shoulderpads}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=The Artificer's Crown}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Scales of Appraisal}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Abnormal Voidmass}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Fey Glider}} and {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Resonator Ring}}.

